{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52976","headline":"偈 · 应真","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘之南，潭之北，中有黄金充一国。\n无影树下合同船，琉璃殿上无知识。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷六，、《五灯会元》卷二、《佛祖历代通载》卷十四、《释氏稽古略》卷三、《江西诗徵》卷八七、日本《大灯国师语录》卷下）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"应真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}